---
import { GITHUB_URL, DOCS } from '../../site';
---
<section class="section" id="open-source" aria-labelledby="os-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="intro reveal">
      <div class="kicker">Open source</div>
      <h2 class="h2" id="os-title" data-words>Built in the open. <span class="soft">Built to be built on.</span></h2>
      <p>devctx is Apache-2.0. Read every line that touches your context, fork it into your own harness, and send back what makes it better.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="os-grid">
      <div class="os-card reveal">
        <span class="os-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#ff8a3d" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 6l-6 6 6 6M16 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Read the code</h3>
        <p>A plain Node CLI with no service behind it. What it does to your files, you can see.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="os-card reveal">
        <span class="os-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#ff8a3d" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="3"/><path d="M9 12h6M12 9v6"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Write a template</h3>
        <p>Skill templates are files. Add one for your team's rituals and seed it with <code>skill template-seed</code>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="os-card reveal">
        <span class="os-ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#ff8a3d" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="2.5"/><path d="M8.3 11l7.4-3.8M8.3 13l7.4 3.8"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Bring another agent</h3>
        <p>Briefs are Markdown and skills are portable. Teach a new agent to read them.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="license reveal">
      <p><strong>Apache-2.0</strong> · local-first · no telemetry, no account</p>
      <!-- TODO: confirm the GitHub org/user (sundharesan11) at release -->
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={GITHUB_URL}>github.com/sundharesan11/developer-context-kit <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
